  {
    "file": "docs\\operations\\runbook.md",
    "line": 73,
    "content": "`curl localhost:8088/healthz | jq '.identification, .consent_cache_stale, .stages.face'`. `stages.face: null` → no face model/biometric key configured (QR only). `consent_cache_stale: true` → `edge-ai sync` failing (check `config_sync_last_error`); the gate fails closed by design. High `ambiguous` counts → two enrolled members look alike at the current threshold; re-enrol with better photos or raise `FaceMatcher.ambiguity_margin`. Members can always fall back to the kiosk QR (admin → Check-in Kiosk)."
  },
