    "line": 18,
    "content": "| **Admin Web** | `omar/apps/admin-web` | Next.js 15.5, React 19, TypeScript, Tailwind | `http://127.0.0.1:3000` | Staff console: reception registration, subscriptions, billing, entrance kiosk (Face + QR), live floor sessions, cameras, zones, equipment, analytics, audit logs |"
  },
  {
    "file": "docs\\SMART_GYM_COMPLETE_AUDIT.md",
    "line": 19,
    "content": "| **Member Web (PWA)** | `omar/apps/member-web` | Next.js 15.5, React 19, MediaPipe Pose (WebAssembly) | `http://127.0.0.1:3001` | Member portal: AI Personal Trainer Camera (live squat/exercise form & rep counter), QR pass, workouts, progress, privacy & biometric consent |"
  },
  {
    "file": "docs\\SMART_GYM_COMPLETE_AUDIT.md",
    "line": 20,
    "content": "| **Edge AI Service** | `omar/services/edge-ai` | Python 3.10, ONNX Runtime, OpenCV, SQLite WAL, Pydantic | `http://127.0.0.1:8088/healthz` | Multi-camera RTSP/webcam worker daemon: YOLOX person detection, ByteTrack/IoU tracking, RTMPose-m 17-keypoint estimation, `BiomechanicalSquatEngine`, offline SQLite queue, cloud sync |"
  },
  {
    "file": "docs\\SMART_GYM_COMPLETE_AUDIT.md",
    "line": 54,
    "content": "| **Device Sync (`device-sync`)** | `omar/supabase/functions/device-sync/index.ts` | Working | **90%** | Syncs active biometric consents, exercise catalog, and zone polygons to `edge-ai` (`http://127.0.0.1:8088/healthz` -> `config_sync_ok: true`) | Live push notification on admin zone edit (currently polls on interval) |"
  },
  {
    "file": "docs\\SMART_GYM_COMPLETE_AUDIT.md",
    "line": 104,
    "content": "2. **Edge AI Live Annotated Video Stream**: `CameraWorker` in `orchestrator.py` processes `webcam://0` frames in Python, but exposes only JSON health metrics on `http://127.0.0.1:8088/healthz` — no `/stream.mjpg` or `/frame.jpg` endpoint exists for Admin Web `/cameras` to display the live annotated floor feed."
  },
  {
    "file": "docs\\SMART_GYM_COMPLETE_AUDIT.md",
    "line": 109,
    "content": "2. **[FIXED] Cross-Port Auth Cookie Collision**: `localhost:3000` and `localhost:3001` previously shared Supabase's default cookie name, logging the user out whenever switching tabs. Fixed via `NEXT_PUBLIC_AUTH_COOKIE_NAME` (`sb-kinetiq-admin-auth` vs `sb-kinetiq-member-auth`)."
  },
  {
    "file": "docs\\SMART_GYM_COMPLETE_AUDIT.md",
    "line": 213,
    "content": "| **P1-2** | **Add HTTP MJPEG / snapshot endpoint to `edge-ai` & release webcam when idle** | `omar/services/edge-ai/edge_ai/health.py`, `pipeline/orchestrator.py`, `omar/apps/admin-web/src/app/(dashboard)/cameras/[id]/page.tsx` | Prevents single-laptop webcam contention between Python `edge-ai` and browser `getUserMedia`, and renders live annotated frames in Admin `/cameras` | Open `http://127.0.0.1:8088/snapshot.jpg` and verify bounding-box + skeleton overlay |"
  },
  {
    "file": "docs\\SMART_GYM_COMPLETE_AUDIT.md",
