    "content": "| **6. Member Web App & AI Personal Trainer Camera** | **91%** | Yes (`http://127.0.0.1:3001`) | **Yes** | Per-rep fault array not persisted to DB on workout save (set totals are persisted) |"
  },
  {
    "file": "docs\\SMART_GYM_COMPLETE_AUDIT.md",
    "line": 231,
    "content": "| **7. Admin Web App & Reception Console** | **89%** | Yes (`http://127.0.0.1:3000`) | **Yes** | `/cameras` polygon editor lacks live MJPEG snapshot feed from `edge-ai` |"
  },
  {
    "file": "docs\\SMART_GYM_COMPLETE_AUDIT.md",
    "line": 256,
    "content": "| **3. Maintain the correct member identity of each trainee?** | **YES (Kiosk + Browser Session) / PARTIAL (Passive RTSP Floor)** | At the entrance kiosk (`localhost:3000/kiosk`), members can enroll their face via webcam and check in with Face Recognition or QR code (`public.enroll_member_face` and `public.face_check_in` RPCs verified live), and in Member Web (`localhost:3001/workout`) the authenticated member's identity is bound directly to their workout session. For passive floor cameras managed by Python `edge-ai`, identity binding works when a single checked-in member enters a zone or via spatial handoff, but passive RTSP face recognition is disabled (`face.missing`) until an ArcFace `.onnx` model is placed in `omar/services/edge-ai/models/`. |"
  },
  {
    "file": "docs\\SMART_GYM_COMPLETE_AUDIT.md",
    "line": 257,
    "content": "| **4. Display the results in a simple frontend?** | **YES** | Member Web (`localhost:3001/workout`) displays a live camera skeleton overlay, knee & torso angles, a **RIGHT FORM / WRONG FORM** banner, and big Valid / Imperfect rep counters. Admin Web (`localhost:3000/sessions` and `/kiosk`) displays live sessions, an embedded AI Trainer Form Monitor, and dual Face/QR check-in. |"
  },
